'''Swimmer Cat''' is a [[:Category:Super Rare Cats|Super Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]]. It was added in [[Version 2.0 Update|Version 2.0]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 6.10 Update|Version 6.10]] increases health, attack power, movement speed and range. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 8.1 Update|Version 8.1]].

